---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About — Shahzaib"
  description="Shahzaib is a software engineer and entrepreneur based in Pakistan, building AI-first software products."
>
  <div class="pt-12 fade-in">
    <h1 class="text-3xl mb-8 leading-tight" style="font-family: var(--font-serif)">
      About
    </h1>

    <div class="flex flex-col gap-8 text-[#374151] leading-relaxed">
      <div class="fade-in fade-in-delay-1">
        <p class="mb-4">
          I'm Shahzaib — a software engineer and entrepreneur based in Pakistan.
          I build at the intersection of AI and software, with a focus on creating
          products that are genuinely useful.
        </p>
        <p>
          Currently, I'm running{' '}
          <a
            href="https://baseera.io"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="text-[var(--color-ink)] underline underline-offset-2 hover:opacity-70 transition-opacity"
          >
            Baseera Labs
          </a>{' '}
          — an AI-first software company focused on product engineering and consulting.
          We build intelligent software that solves real problems.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="fade-in fade-in-delay-2">
        <h2 class="text-xl mb-3 font-medium">What I'm building</h2>
        <p class="mb-3">
          <strong class="font-medium text-[var(--color-ink)]">Simplora.ai</strong>{' '}
          — AI meeting management. Pre-meeting briefs, real-time summaries, automatic
          action item extraction. Helping teams run meetings that actually lead somewhere.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong class="font-medium text-[var(--color-ink)]">DreamdeskAI</strong>{' '}
          — AI for hospitality. A RAG-powered knowledge platform with an AI concierge
          for hotels, integrated directly into WhatsApp.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="fade-in fade-in-delay-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl mb-3 font-medium">Background</h2>
        <p class="mb-3">
          I studied Computer Science at NUCES (FAST), graduating in 2024. During
          my studies I published first-author research on LLM-assisted property
          generation for Solidity smart contracts — exploring how AI can strengthen
          software verification.
        </p>
        <p>
          I started Baseera Labs the same year, running it with two partners:
          Aqib on lead generation and Ali on sales and delivery.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="fade-in fade-in-delay-4">
        <h2 class="text-xl mb-3 font-medium">Stack & interests</h2>
        <p class="mb-3">
          I work across the full stack — Python (FastAPI, LangChain, LangGraph),
          Node.js / TypeScript, Next.js, React, Docker, GCP, PostgreSQL, and
          various vector databases. Most of my work lives at the AI layer.
        </p>
        <p>
          Outside of building, I'm interested in AI/ML research, entrepreneurship,
          and what the future of software engineering looks like when LLMs are
          first-class collaborators.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Contact -->
    <div class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-[var(--color-border)] fade-in fade-in-delay-4">
      <h2 class="text-xl mb-3 font-medium">Get in touch</h2>
      <p class="text-[var(--color-muted)] mb-4">
        Want to collaborate, discuss AI, or just say hi?
      </p>
      <a
        href="mailto:hello@shahzaib.ai"
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-[var(--color-ink)] underline underline-offset-2 hover:opacity-70 transition-opacity font-medium"
      >
        hello@shahzaib.ai
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
